#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You gotta be kidding me. You act like you're so high and mighty."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's... I dunno, demeaning or whatever."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No biggie, just find another way of speaking. It's not like there's a shortage of words in the world."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa. Didn't realize you were so sensitive."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh man, I'm sorry, I didn't mean it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah well. It's cool. Just a note for the future."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I have opinions, all right?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm garbage. I'm trash."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But I'm not worthless."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sue me."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Bye."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I've already told you this once, why am I having to say it again."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't like that kinda talk. I'm a fairly easygoing can. Don't think I'm asking for a lot."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't get it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh come on, it's just a word!"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm seriously warning you now."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Choose your words carefully."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok ok, I got it. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... I forgot. Won't happen again."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay - my word is 'you suck'."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/c-0/7 cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/c-1/7 cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "These were the wrong words to choose. Cam turns his back and leaves."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's two words, asshat."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah, and words don't have power, right?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Battle cries, and manifestos, and national anthems? That's all just a lot of hot air, right?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It means something to me, is all I'm saying."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, Cam. Good point. I'll watch it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gotcha. I'll try, I promise."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh for can's sake."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Out."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/12
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You kidding me?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, come on, you're not offended again, are you?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no, I didn't... hang on..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I swear there were no good options!"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I gotta tell ya. I have had it right up to my lid with this shit."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "This subtle judgment. This super-cool dismissal and mockery..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And then the \"niceness,\" almost like by insulting me you're doing me a favor."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You think I don't know what I am? You think I need to be reminded, like I've forgotten what I do?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And more importantly, you think that by reminding me or shaming me, you're gonna change me??"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Never gonna happen."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Give it up, walk away, check your own bullshit that you think you have any right to tell me what to do, how to do it, or especially what to like."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't even care whether or not you mean to do it, but stop. Figure it out and stop."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/64
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And if you can't stop, if you just have to fix things around you to make yourself more comfortable..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/72
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Got a solution for ya."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/80
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Don't be around me."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/88
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I like me. I really like me. I have no intention of changing or adjusting for you or anyone and if you don't like it, it's no plastic off my ass."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/96
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You can bring your trash to me or not, talk to me or not, but degrade or denigrate me one more time and I'll turn your kitchen into a toxic waste pit."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/104
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And I'll enjoy it, too."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/112
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Have a peach of a day."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You came back."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Pigs do fly, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How could I stay away? Hoping for another vitriolic outburst."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're irritating... but I think you may have been right."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to apolog... wait did you just call me a pig?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Careful what you wish for."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still sensitive, I see."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wasn't trying to piss you off, y'know."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Are we really going to do this dance again?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not rising to the same bait twice."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So if you're looking for a toy to play with, I'm sure the neighbor's cat has something you might like."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sure you don't? Gotta be something diverting in this junk heap."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm allergic, but thanks."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not trying to bait you. Just... you have to admit you're a little touchy."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ugh. Definitely wasn't being serious."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Look, was there anything you wanted to say to me?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Get to it. Cuz if not, I'm talked out with you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. I wanted to say your rant was totally uncalled for."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You hurt my feelings, Cam."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ah. Feelings."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, you kinda hurt mine too, since we're sharing."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry. I was just expressing myself, but I clearly upset you. I'm apologizing. Can you?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, please. It was just teasing."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sure I can. And I will when I think I've done something wrong."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I defended myself. That's still allowed."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You totally flew off the handle!"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm telling you that you hurt me. Isn't that enough to warrant an apology?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's what you call it??"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So you expressing yourself is healthy, and when I do it, I'm flying off the handle??"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm done. I don't even have the will, much less the energy to explain this again."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Thanks for the trash. The deposits are gold."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/39
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But I think that's where this experiment in talking to each other is gonna end."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I mean, I guess..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh damn."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/39
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're not gonna say \"psych\" or \"gotcha\" or something stupid if I say I'm sorry, are you?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who would do that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That wasn't my plan, no."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You'd be surprised."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ok, then."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm sorry that I hurt your feelings."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe both of us are... sensitive."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It shouldn't be this easy for someone to upset you, right?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Shouldn't we... shouldn't I be tougher?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We can work on not letting people get to us."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/48/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope. I actually really like you just the way you are."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Look. I don't usually even go in for the whole feelings parade thing."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And if the best you can do is make fun of me, and then make fun of me reacting to getting made fun of..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I have better things to do."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like what, separate glass and plastic?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're just so much more sensitive than I thought a trash can would be."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah. I'm bored of this."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "One, never said I wasn't."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Two, there's nothing wrong with that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Three, if it bothers you so much, why the hell did you come back?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-2/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Y'know what? Don't answer that. I'm done."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I can only imagine how effective you would've been if you'd meant to do it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. I am way better at things when I actually care about them."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We just have different styles. Different things we like."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Kinda curious now."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Wanna try and upset me and see how well you do?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, not really. Didn't have a lot of fun the last time you were peeved."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, why not. Could be fun, right?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Smart move."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I wasn't kidding about the toxic waste site thing."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "One time, I actually did it by accident... my bag broke while this joker was on vacation and stuff leaked out onto the floor for like ten days."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It was gross. I was so proud."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...that was me. That was last year, Cam."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Weird thing to be proud of, man."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...oh."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/18
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Guess that'll teach ya to leave a full bag of trash in the house when you head out to the beach, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, lesson learned."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I won't do it again now I know you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Awesome. Glad to hear it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So. Anything else on your mind, or...?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, actually... wanted to tell you you're kinda hot when you're mad..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really. Just wanted to make sure we were cool."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "As far as I'm concerned, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "We don't have to agree on everything."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "As long as we aren't dicks to each other, the truck keeps on runnin'."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You didn't seriously just say that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Weird? My pride is weird? Why, because it's trash?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not doing this again. Thanks for the regular deliveries; keep 'em up."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But no more talking. I'm not going to hold your hand as you learn how not to say boneheaded things to me."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Are you serious?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Do you actually want to try and piss me off or do you seriously think it could be fun?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it could be fun. I like sparring with you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...neither. I was actually just trying to end the conversation nicely."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sparring."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What are we, knights? MMA fighters?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. Verbal MMA fighters. It's kinda sexy."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's just fun to talk to someone who's quick. Smart."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Wait. So this whole time... you were having fun."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "We were playing."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, not the whole time. You can be intense."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For sure. Why do you think I kept talking?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. That's interesting."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I guess I'm so used to people judging me, I didn't think anyone could trade barbs and be... enjoying it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh, sure. That makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Let me help you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh yeah? And what do you like?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lots of stuff. Food, music. Sleeping."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you know you've never asked me that before?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sounds... generic."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, I never said I was a trailblazer."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So is a grilled cheese, but show me a more perfect food."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ha. Fair enough."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I haven't had a grilled cheese in a long time."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. I finish them every time I make them so... none left for you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We could rectify that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well then. Let's make some grilled cheese."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Pretty sure I've got the bread butts in here somewhere..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh... cool."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, it's ok, I'll use new bread. Before we do that, though, I am sorry for insulting you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gotta love a good butt. And a good apology also?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/c-0/10
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Here you go, fresh butts."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah. Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/c-0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Was there something else you wanted to say now that you know you've been a dick and I made you food?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/c-0/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know I should apologize, I'm just bad at it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...really?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yup. Really."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Um... no. No, I didn't realize that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm... oh hell, I don't know, I'm sorry I guess."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm just used to people assuming I'm dirty. Or dumb."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "They jump down my throat before I even get the chance to give a shit about them."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know. I think I might have done that. My bad."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Easy mistake to make."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe if you were a little more interested in others, they'd be more interested in you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And why is it my responsibility to go first?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Why do I have to start that?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're talking like it's a two way street and I think you're right."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's not my obligation to be nice to everyone when most of them are assholes to me."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look, I see where you're coming from, but is it always going to be someone else's responsibility?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No wonder you're a loner, you're making this so complicated!"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, then how about you and I just be nice to each other and nevermind everybody else."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not theirs any more than mine!"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not going to be some kind of social martyr and be nice to others on the off-chance they'll treat me well in return."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Talk about capital wasted."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm fine on my own. I'm not lookin' to throw good attitude away hoping to \"make a friend.\""
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Making a friend isn't worth the effort?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So why try, basically."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If I'm the only one trying, putting in the effort, no."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If that's always my job, that's not a friend."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. I've never... thought about that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're such a pessimist. I think maybe we just don't have a lot in common."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, think about it. Before you ask me, again, why I'm being \"disinterested.\""
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Coulda told you that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And you don't care?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess I should've listened. Maybe we can just each do our own thing, then."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not really. I care that I'm me and you're you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm just not gonna stress out about us not being besties and riding off into the sunset."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's a waste of everyone's time."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's not waste any more time, then."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nothin' wrong with that. Kind of a pleasant way to be with each other, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No pressure."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So I can think you're a pessimist and we can still be cool?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll just bring you trash, and you'll take it, and we can be ok?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Exactly. You do what you do. I'll do what I do."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And what you think of me doesn't change what I am."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So... think whatever the hell you want."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No, YOU are!"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/18
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're trying to tell me that it's my responsibility to be nice to others on the off chance that they'll be put off by me..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/26
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's somehow my job to apologize and fall all over myself trying not to upset anybody with my personality and I'm telling you..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/34
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "BULL."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh man... is that what I'm saying?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're making it sound bad. I just mean it's an easier way to be social."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Kinda. It's... insulting, but more importantly, it's not a way to live."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nobody should have to do that. And when they do, all they're doing is putting this fake, apologetic version of themselves out into the world."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sooner or later, that falls apart. And then you find that the people around you don't know who you really are."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe you don't even know who you really are."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...you're really smart, Cam."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know. Sounds like you're just trying to rationalize being a jerk sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever. If you didn't want friends, why did you talk to me at all?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "At least you didn't sound shocked that time."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha. Yeah. Starting to get you a little more."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm definitely shocked. I think you like that I'm shocked."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not all that complex."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just pay attention, is all."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I think most of us are like that. We'll tell you who we are. All you have to do is listen."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There you go again. Smart."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I'm listening now. And I like what I hear."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haha. You're starting to sound like one of those inspirational tea bags."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah yeah yeah. Careful. My ego's plenty healthy."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...um sure. I... are you hitting on me?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hmmmm or am I?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh gee, I wonder, what could I be doing..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just tell me."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't handle teasing well, do you?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, Cam. You're attractive. I'm hitting on you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If you threw away fewer used tea bags, I probably wouldn't sound that way, now would I?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Anyway, they're kinda wise. What's wrong with taking in some herbal wisdom."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing. I like it, actually. I like talking to you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not exactly original. But it's cool."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well. Maybe."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So I like to get a rise out of people sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I never said I was an angel."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't like you so much if you were."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Devils are sexier anyway."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Say what?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So what's the problem?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Even if that's what I'm doing, who cares? You don't have to get it. You don't have to agree."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not trying to convince you of anything."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you can't just go around being a jerk!"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, that's good because I'm not convinced at all."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Let's just agree that we're not gonna agree on this. How 'bout that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You think I'm a deluded jerk, and I think you're kind of a pushy fixer."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's not required that we like each other."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, it's not. But I'd like at least to understand you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine. I guess you'll do you and I'll do me and that'll be it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All I've done is be nice to you. How dare you call me pushy."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Can't I just be a deluded jerk?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe you were right the first time."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Know what? Maybe I was."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Possibly. I also just like you, and I think I can do better."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not hard, is it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope, not really. Later."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. Makes sense, I guess. We can just... each be ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
