msgid "I was acting like a jerk."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I can be controlling."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah. Well."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nobody's perfect, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm trying to apologize here."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that... that's all you have to say?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't get a lot of apologies."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Don't generally ask for them, either. So."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "This is weird."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha! Nice to see you on the back foot, for once."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'll get used to it. Or maybe I'll be unique, who knows."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah, well, don't get used to it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'll recover from the shock and be back to my old snarky self in no time."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm counting on it. I... I kinda like your snarky self."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'd better be. If we're going to be friends, we've both gotta keep it interesting."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You what?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like you. Sorry, how could I be more clear about that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're definitely unique. And weird."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Those are good things, though. I'm unique and weird."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trust me, I noticed. Looking forward to being your friend."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yes, you are. I love it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "My what?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your friend. Kinda thought we could be friends."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, just try it. Might be fun."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I think you mean you find the weirdness stimulating."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Fun to think about. Diverting."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Pretty sure you don't mean \"love.\""
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm pretty sure I do."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Would it be so bad if I loved you?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It would be really weird if you loved me."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not cuz I don't deserve it, or anything. This isn't therapy. Just cuz..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't know, just because..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Know what, we don't have to analyze it right now."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I understand. Might be weird if you loved me, too."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I guess it's unfamiliar. Which isn't necessarily bad. Just weird. Just new."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I have been told I'm hot, though. So maybe it makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah you are. But it's not just that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Careful, Cam. You might make me love you more."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's just a phrase. For when something's unlikely?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It was as likely that you'd come back here as it is that a pig would learn to fly?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You've really never heard that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I haven't."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why is it so unlikely I'd come back?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, I pretty much bodyslammed you the last time we talked. Most people would decide that casual friendliness with a trash can wasn't worth a verbal ass-whooping."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So why are you here."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because I was wrong. And I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because my ass kinda liked the whooping."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because I still need to throw stuff away, and I figured you'd be a pill about it if I didn't come back here and pretend to be contrite."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And that just got said."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Guess \"casual friendliness\" ain't really what you're after."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really, no. I totally dug how powerful you were."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We can be friendly, too... but I really like you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well you get points for honesty."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I won't be a pill. I want the trash, you have the trash, give it to me freely."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-2/20
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And don't worry about \"buttering me up\" in the future."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-2/25
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I have even less need of your friendship than you seem to have of mine."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I got dumped once."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah yeah yeah, a trash can getting dumped. I've heard it before, save your breath."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I was bummed. Broken heart, wanted them back. I was a little pathetic about it, begging and wondering what I did wrong. I was going back and forth between crying about it and hating them so much."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Took up a lot of my energy. For a while, actually."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But then Abel gave me some really great perspective on it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Wanna hear it?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Couldn't care less."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh fine, what the hell."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "He told me to be really grateful to them. For dumping me. For being an asshole to me the whole time we were together."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I didn't get it. How could I be grateful? Why should I be grateful?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And Abel told me that they had actually done me a huge favor."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "They'd made it unavoidably clear that I didn't have to spend one more minute thinking about them, worrying about what they thought, caring about how they felt."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I was done. I was free."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I've been done and free ever since."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You've done me that same favor all over again. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'd say I hope you have a great day..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/64
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But I don't care anymore."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/109
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I've seen that technique - the dumpee taking the high road."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/117
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Feel bad, until you remember they're literal trash."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Y'know, I've been thinking about our fight."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fight? More like you kinda blindsiding me."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh! That. No biggie."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I have, too."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I wanted to say..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hmph. This is harder than I thought."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I wanted to say I'm... pretty impressed."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Impressed. By what?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. That's nice of you to say."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It takes guts to stand up for yourself."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Takes guts to admit you were wrong, to apologize."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "In my experience, anyway, that kinda courage is... rare."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I appreciate that, Cam."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haven't always been brave. I guess I'm learning."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A friend like you is worth a little risk."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Anyway. We don't have to let it go to our heads or anything."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How would being friends go to our heads?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I heard about this movie once where these two women went on a crazy road trip and then a killing spree and then they drove off a cliff holding hands."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And they were friends. So."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's a pretty dark conclusion, Cam."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-3/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think them being friends was the only factor there."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "We can just stick to trash. And sarcasm."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And appreciating each other sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "This may come as a shock but... I don't have a lot of friends."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't have a lot of practice because, frankly, I don't like... anybody."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess I'm flattered, then."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh man, I don't either."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So we'll keep it simple."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I can handle that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. I have a friend."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. And you have a bad-ass hat."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/10
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "For real?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/18
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just so you know, I never let anyone try my shit."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/26
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But... you wanna try it?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yes."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm good."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I knew I liked you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "We're friends now. Put on the fucking hat."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/34/g-0/3
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You look good in yellow."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. So this is a thing that's happening."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I was gonna pour some cold expired milk on ya..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But what the hell."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I know I'm hot, I might as well get something out of it."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are hot. You're my new favorite dumpster fire."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do it. Let's get trashy."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You are creative. I like that."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If you'd tried to pull that wordplay before..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You would've gone off on me and called me an elitist?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You didn't trust me before. How could you know I wasn't making fun?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Exactly. But I guess you are making fun now, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Creating, fun."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hey... whaddya say we find a quiet spot and see if I've got anything else fun hidden away in here?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wham Bam, thank you, Cam..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/c-4/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Haha... found this."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/c-4/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cam pulls out a positively ancient cucumber, a devilish glint in his brown eyes."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/c-4/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How old is it..."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/c-4/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He places the wrinkled cucumber to your lips, quieting you."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/c-4/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nononono shhhhhhh....."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You have got to be kidding me."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I know... here I am again."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What? I have trash."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look... I just wanted to say I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And I'm supposed to what, fall on my knees and thank the heavens for your presence?"
msgstr ""

#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
